  "description": "Upgrade your vehicle's interior protection with OEDRO all-weather floor mats, crafted from high-quality TPE material. Designed for maximum durability and flexibility, these mats shield your carpet from rain, snow, mud, and spills while remaining odor-free and environmentally friendly. Their innovative construction ensures a secure fit, superior comfort, and easy maintenance—simply rinse and reinstall.\nFeatures\nAll-Weather Protection: Defends against rain, snow, mud, and spills to keep your vehicle's carpet clean year-round.\nDurable & Flexible TPE Material: Tough yet pliable, with superior resistance to heat, cold, and wear compared to traditional PVC.\nSecure & Comfortable Fit: Injection-molded air pockets enhance comfort while ridges grip the carpet to prevent shifting.\nOdor-Free & Eco-Friendly: Non-toxic, fire-resistant, and UV-resistant, ensuring a safe and pleasant interior.\nQuick & Easy Cleaning : Simply remove, hose off, and reinstall for effortless maintenance.\n2-years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible for 2017-2026 Ford F-250/F-350 Super Duty Crew Cab, with 1st-row Bucket Seats.\nWith under Seat Storage only",
